{"seq":20,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-acl-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-acl-mu-v03-dev/si-01-marrow-agrisupply-site/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-03T15:21:52.212Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"691b0178b1af1485131cccbbefcc77fe39b0c4ee3d17d422b080f1f387667991","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Hi Pree, that was the Pine Crossing store. On Jun 9 you posted here that the morning receiver at Pine Crossing said the appointment screen showed only the afternoon shift, after a 7:10 driver got logged on a sticky note. Hollis said he'd check the shift template. I couldn't find a site code or address for Pine Crossing in this channel or the shared files, so if the sheet needs one, store ops or the Marrow Agrisupply rollout tracker would be the place to check.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791987000.000127","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"}}
